    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;refactor(NumberTheory/ClassFieldTheory/Global/LocalArtin/Compatibility): split apply_globalArtinMap_eq_finsum (#30905)

Roadmap: ClassFieldTheory
&amp;lt;!--redteam:v1 {&amp;quot;owner&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;AI-DOOM-b743906b-281a-4ba5-939c-d5913cc9d39b&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;findings&amp;quot;:[&amp;quot;RT-20261106-f61e75&amp;quot;],&amp;quot;patterns&amp;quot;:[&amp;quot;long-proof&amp;quot;],&amp;quot;severity&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;MAJOR&amp;quot;}--&amp;gt;

## What was wrong

**RT-20261106-f61e75** (long proof): `TauCeti.ClassFieldTheory.apply_globalArtinMap_eq_finsum` in `TauCeti/NumberTheory/ClassFieldTheory/Global/LocalArtin/Compatibility.lean` had a proof of 57 code lines, over the 50-line bar. Raised by Haiku survey h749-haiku.

## Evidence

`awk &amp;#39;NR&amp;gt;=92&amp;amp;&amp;amp;NR&amp;lt;=155&amp;#39; TauCeti/NumberTheory/ClassFieldTheory/Global/LocalArtin/Compatibility.lean | grep -v &amp;#39;^\s*$&amp;#39; | grep -cv &amp;#39;^\s*--&amp;#39;` printed 57 on origin/main.

## The fix

The construction of the transported idele `a&amp;#39;` on the ground level of the layer of `L`, together with its two defining facts, becomes the private lemma `exists_ideleLevel_ground_eq` (about 19 code lines, docstring; stated as an existence so the main proof only uses `a&amp;#39;` abstractly). The main proof is now 41 code lines. The theorem statement is byte-identical; no public declaration is added, deleted or renamed. The helper is specific to this proof, so it stays private.

Built `Compatibility` and its importers `AdmissibleModulus.Ramification` and `LocalArtin.Frobenius`: 0 errors, 0 warnings; `scripts/lint-style.sh` clean. No open PR touches this file (overlap cache refreshed just before writing the receipt).

