    <title>
        refactor(AlgebraicGeometry/AdicSpace/Spa/Polydisc/PolynomialDomain): …
    </title>
    <updated>2026-11-06T22:42:12Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/298123923?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>tauceti-redteam</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/tauceti-redteam</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;refactor(AlgebraicGeometry/AdicSpace/Spa/Polydisc/PolynomialDomain): split isHoledDiscUnion_cell_inter by case (#29683)

Roadmap: AdicSpaces
&amp;lt;!--redteam:v1 {&amp;quot;owner&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;AI-DOOM-b743906b-281a-4ba5-939c-d5913cc9d39b&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;findings&amp;quot;:[&amp;quot;RT-20261106-276b03&amp;quot;],&amp;quot;patterns&amp;quot;:[&amp;quot;long-proof&amp;quot;],&amp;quot;severity&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;MAJOR&amp;quot;}--&amp;gt;

## What was wrong
The private lemma `TauCeti.ValuationSpectrum.isHoledDiscUnion_cell_inter` (`AlgebraicGeometry/AdicSpace/Spa/Polydisc/PolynomialDomain.lean`) had a 62-code-line proof, over the 50-line limit. Its three branches of `lt_trichotomy m n` (`m &amp;lt; n`, `m = n`, `n &amp;lt; m`) are independent blocks. Raised by Haiku survey H210-haiku; count re-measured.

## Evidence
`awk &amp;#39;NR&amp;gt;=263&amp;amp;&amp;amp;NR&amp;lt;=325&amp;#39; TauCeti/AlgebraicGeometry/AdicSpace/Spa/Polydisc/PolynomialDomain.lean | grep -v &amp;#39;^\s*$&amp;#39; | grep -cv &amp;#39;^\s*--&amp;#39;` printed 62 on origin/main (afa08a3ed1). After the change the proof body has 22 code lines; the three new helpers have 13, 13 and 17.

## The fix
Three new private lemmas, each documented, `exists_isHoledDiscUnion_cell_inter_of_lt`, `_of_eq` and `_of_gt`. Each states, for abstract `m n : ℕ` and `c e : K`, that the cell inequality `x(T - γ)ᵐ x(c) ≤ x(T - γ)ⁿ x(e)` is cut out of the cell by a set `H` with `cell ∩ H` a finite union of holed discs (the case-specific hypothesis: `e ≠ 0`, and for `m ≤ n` that `m = 0` where `x(T - γ)` vanishes). The main lemma keeps the `set` bindings, the reduction `suffices` (the former `key`) and applies the three helpers. Its statement is byte-identical; no public declaration touched, nothing deleted or renamed. The one importer-visible surface is unchanged (the lemma is private).
Built `TauCeti.AlgebraicGeometry.AdicSpace.Spa.Polydisc.PolynomialDomain` (no importer outside the file mentions the private names; `lake env lean` on the file prints no messages); `scripts/lint-style.sh` clean.

## Overlapping open PRs
#26591 (a large human PR, &amp;quot;fix: remove unused tactic bindings surfaced by main&amp;quot;) touches this file. Its only change here replaces `fun x hx ↦ ?_` by `fun x _ ↦ ?_` in the old `n &amp;lt; m` branch; `git merge-tree --write-tree` of this head with its head reports a textual conflict in this file. The new `_of_gt` helper already writes `fun x _ ↦ ?_`, so whichever lands second resolves by taking this PR&amp;#39;s version of the region. It is not a red-team PR.

🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)

